<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for reaching out to the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We always want your journey with us to be seamless from start to finish, so I’m sorry to learn about your concerns regarding announcements on departure from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If complaining of volume/clarity of announcements include:</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Airport announcements</strong><br />
<br />
We understand how important clear and timely communication is while making your way through the terminal and I apologise for any <strong><em>&lt;confusion/delays&gt;</em></strong> this may have caused.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If customer missed boarding, include:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to learn that you didn't hear our announcements and missed boarding for {{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}. We always try to make sure boarding times are clearly printed on each customer’s boarding pass and are displayed on departure boards throughout the terminal and lounges, so<br />
customers can plan their walk to the gate in time for boarding.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I’ve passed your comments on to the Airport Management in {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} so we can work to improve this aspect of our service in future.<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>